title: 'the hide report as built: each choice, why, and which were Jeff''s'
pid: 41d36710-9473-4b9e-b7aa-648c5cd8f7c9
body: |2-
  Built 2026-11-14 at Top's request, on Jeff's priority of tools that make
  our writing easier for him to digest. Jeff decided none of these; each
  was made for him and is reversible. The protocol and the exact words are
  in 'docs/api-and-formats.org', "Save buffer".
